WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.100
The window shows the session greet

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:04.590
C-c C-t lists the sessions, and typing narrows the list to notes

00:00:04.590 --> 00:00:06.290
The window now shows notes, and its tab is selected

00:00:06.290 --> 00:00:09.210
C-c C-t again, back to greet

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:11.000
greet is back in the window
